<title>USA: U.S. Office Products to join Nasdaq 100.</title>
<headline>U.S. Office Products to join Nasdaq 100.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Office Products Co said Friday it will join the Nasdaq-100 Index on July 1.</p>
<p>The Nasdaq-100 includes the 100 largest, non-financial stocks traded on Nasdaq.</p>
</text>
